<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>Blog Title</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io</link><description>Blog description</description><copyright>Blog Title</copyright><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><image><url>https://github.githubassets.com/favicons/favicon.svg</url><title>avatar</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io</link></image><lastBuildDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 03:33:17 +0000</lastBuildDate><managingEditor>Blog Title</managingEditor><ttl>60</ttl><webMaster>Blog Title</webMaster><item><title>Bugku source Write up</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20source%20Write%20up.html</link><description>平台：Bugku CTF
题目类型：Web
题目名称：source
考察知识点：.git源码泄露、git reflog恢复被删除的提交记录

访问题目所给靶机地址，页面处未找到falg，Ctrl+U查看网页源代码得到“flag”，提交“flag”显示flag错误，判断flag不带当前页面。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20source%20Write%20up.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 03:32:49 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bugku POST Write up</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20POST%20Write%20up.html</link><description>打开题目所给靶机地址，出现代码：
$what=$_POST['what'];
echo $what;
if($what=='flag')
echo 'flag{****}';
通过代码中的“POST”判断其为POST题型，需要构造POST请求。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20POST%20Write%20up.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 06:02:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bugku 聪明的小羊 Write up</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20-cong-ming-de-xiao-yang-%20Write%20up.html</link><description>初见题目，通过题目类型可知为Crypot，通过对题目的描述“栅栏”，“2”等字样推测其为栅栏加密形式，且栏数为2，通过Bugku自带栅栏解密工具可解flag，，输入flag，flag正确，完活。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20-cong-ming-de-xiao-yang-%20Write%20up.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 06:33:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bugku /.- Write up</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20-.-%20Write%20up.html</link><description>初见题目，发现该题目类型为Crypot，通过编码形式/.-判断其为摩斯密码，通过摩斯密码解码工具得到flag，完活。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20-.-%20Write%20up.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 06:27:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bugku 头等舱 Writeup</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20-tou-deng-cang-%20Writeup.html</link><description>打开题目所给网址，发现网页出现一行文字：“什么也没有”，通过查看源代码，啥也找不着，通过Brup Suite对该网址进行抓包，将其放到Repeater中，发现头部信息存在flag，完活。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20-tou-deng-cang-%20Writeup.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 12:57:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bugku GET Writeup</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20GET%20Writeup.html</link><description>打开题目所给网址，通过代码可知，$what=='flag'，此时我们不灵光的脑子突然灵机一动，在题目所给网址后加上/?what=111(任意数字)，发现网页中出现对应数字，重复上述步骤，键入/?what=flag，即可得到flag，完活。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20GET%20Writeup.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 12:47:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bugku inspect-me Writeup</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20inspect-me%20Writeup.html</link><description>打开题目所给网址，让后打开源代码，发现flag格式为shellmates{*****}形式，找到flag，完活。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20inspect-me%20Writeup.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 11:52:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bugku 你必须让它停下 Writeup</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20-ni-bi-xu-rang-ta-ting-xia-%20Writeup.html</link><description>法1：打开题目所给网址，发现该页面在不断刷新，且页面提示停止刷新就能得到flag，通过不断刷新源代码得到flag，完活。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20-ni-bi-xu-rang-ta-ting-xia-%20Writeup.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 11:43:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bugku alert Writeup</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20alert%20Writeup.html</link><description>打开题目所给网址，发现网址重复出现“flag就在这里”，“来找找吧”字样，摁F12或Ctrl+U查找源代码，下划发现&amp;#+数字字样，发现其为HTML编码，
通过HTML编码解码工具https://www.lddgo.net/convert/htmlencode解得flag，完活。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20alert%20Writeup.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 08:40:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bugku 计算器 Writeup</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20-ji-suan-qi-%20Writeup.html</link><description>打开题目所给网址，发现是一个加法计算式，填写答案验证发现只能填写一位数字，查看源代码，未能找到flag，通过观察发现js/code.js，点击发现该代码里有falg，完活。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20-ji-suan-qi-%20Writeup.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 08:33:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bugku 滑稽 Writeup</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20-hua-ji-%20Writeup.html</link><description>打开题目所给地址发现一堆滑稽笑脸，通过查看网页源代码发现flag，完活。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Bugku%20-hua-ji-%20Writeup.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 07:56:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Hello world</title><link>https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Hello%20world.html</link><description>I'm here,ready for the Cybersecurity world。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://3096202307.github.io/Cgoc04.github.io/post/Hello%20world.html</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 14:17:35 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>